    "detailed_description": "Christmas is coming, Santa is on his way. However, not everyone likes his visiting,  play this game to find out why.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt's snowball fighting in VR! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nMove your head to dodge incoming attacks, and counter their snowballs with yours to show them your excellent snowball fighting skills. <br />\r\nCompete your high score with other players and rank yourself as high as possible on the leader board!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a game designed for VR from the ground up, No keyboard or controllers are required, very easy to pick up.<br />\r\nA fun and entertaining game for you and your family!",
